  "m_dialogList": {
    "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.ActorDialogList, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
    "m_dialogs": [
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Prep",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "MR-THIE-NPC13_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Now what's a nice kid like you doing in a wretched hive like this? You owe the Baboon money too? Either way, I'm glad you're here.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Ophidian_Thug_F_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_MIR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/SnakePlizkin_MIR_56.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1391111,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "MR-THIE-NPC13_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Let's just say civilian life isn't the cakewalk I expected. Truth be told, I haven't slept a wink since I first escaped from Tetrus Prison.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Ophidian_Thug_F_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_MIR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/SnakePlizkin_MIR_57.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1391111,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "MR-THIE-NPC13_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Can't say I miss the beatings from the Boa guards, or the general stink of the place. No, I just can't stop thinking about what I left behind.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Ophidian_Thug_F_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_MIR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/SnakePlizkin_MIR_58.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1391111,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "MR-THIE-NPC13_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "I was so focused on escaping that I forgot my Box of personal effects. It was all packed and ready. I just forgot it, even when we went back.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Ophidian_Thug_F_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_MIR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/SnakePlizkin_MIR_59.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1391111,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "MR-THIE-NPC13_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "I don't know what you're up to these days. Tell you the truth, I don't want to know. But if I recall, you do owe me a favor.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Ophidian_Thug_F_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_MIR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/SnakePlizkin_MIR_60.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1391111,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "MR-THIE-NPC13_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "If you can get my Box out of Solitary in Tetrus Prison, we'd be even. One caveat - do NOT open the Box. All right? All right. Good luck, pal.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Ophidian_Thug_F_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_MIR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/SnakePlizkin_MIR_61.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1391111,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Underway",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "MR-THIE-NPC13_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "I see you, but I don't see my Box. Guess that means we don't have much to talk about.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Ophidian_Thug_F_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_MIR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/SnakePlizkin_MIR_62.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1391111,
